---
kind: lore
id: tavi
title: Tavi's galley
---

<beat id="bounty" on="talk" target="npc.tavi" title="Tavi's bounty" priority="30" when="!holds('felled', ['eel']) && quest.eelBounty.state != 'active'">
  @tavi{code="0010"}: That eel in the long hall. Kill it and drag a piece home and I'll pay you in pearls. And in dinner.
  <branch id="bountyAnswer" prompt="Tavi sharpens a knife meaningfully.">
    <choice id="take" text="Take the bounty">
      @ilo{code="0010"}: One eel. Coming up.
      ::accept{quest="eelBounty" at="nextRun"}
    </choice>
    <choice id="pass" text="Not this dive">
      @tavi{code="0020"}: Your loss. It's very good eel.
    </choice>
  </branch>
</beat>

<beat id="meal" on="talk" target="npc.tavi" title="Something hot" priority="20">
  @tavi{code="0010"}: Sit. Eat. You're blue round the edges.
  ::set{run.sharedMeal = true}
  <match subject="user.deaths">
    <when is="0">
      @tavi{code="0020"}: Nobody's died on my food yet. Don't be first.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @tavi{code="0030" emotion="wry"}: I've fed a dead man {{user.deaths:plural(once|# times)}} now. I should charge double.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</beat>

<entry id="taviRich" on="talk" target="npc.tavi" category="bark" priority="5" when="user.pearls >= 20">
  @tavi{code="0010" emotion="delighted"}: Look at you, jingling. Buy the crew a round sometime.
</entry>

<entry id="taviBark" on="talk" target="npc.tavi" category="bark">
  @tavi{code="0010"}: Pot's on. It's always on.
</entry>
